      "desc": "<color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color>: Manato accumulates Energy over time. The lower the HP of the active character, the faster Manato's Energy Generation. With enough energy, press Auxiliary Assist to summon Manato to launch an <color=#FFFFFF>Auxiliary Assist</color> attack on enemies, equalize all Agents in the squad ' HP and <color=#2BAD00>restore 20% HP</color>. all Agents in the squad gain the <color=#FFFFFF>Molten Edge</color> status. While in the <color=#FFFFFF>Molten Edge</color> status, Agents' <color=#2BAD00>CRIT DMG is increased by 50%</color>, lasting 40s.",
